{"logId": "d73d0e95-3645-4349-88d6-38ce2b7cf79d", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [166, 141, 455, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 141.0], [455.0, 141.0], [455.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [165, 214, 300, 236], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 214.0], [299.0, 214.0], [299.0, 235.0], [165.0, 235.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、经常性埋怨、抱怨、自怨自艾、怨天尤人的状态", "block_bbox": [182, 253, 595, 276], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 253.0], [595.0, 253.0], [595.0, 276.0], [182.0, 276.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、经常依靠感性面对和处理问题，缺乏理性思考的习惯", "block_bbox": [182, 283, 629, 305], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 283.0], [629.0, 283.0], [629.0, 305.0], [182.0, 305.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、经常压抑情绪", "block_bbox": [183, 313, 325, 335], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[182.99998474121094, 312.9999694824219], [323.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219], [323.99993896484375, 333.9999694824219], [182.99998474121094, 333.9999694824219]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、将情绪转移到他人身上，故意不尊重、伤害他人的言行", "block_bbox": [182, 342, 647, 364], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 342.0], [647.0, 342.0], [647.0, 364.0], [182.0, 364.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、时常指责他人而不自我反思", "block_bbox": [183, 372, 433, 393], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.99998474121094, 371.9999694824219], [431.99993896484375, 371.9999694824219], [431.99993896484375, 391.9999694824219], [182.99998474121094, 391.9999694824219]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、认为人生不如意十之八九是正常，感觉工作和生活总有很多烦恼和压力", "block_bbox": [183, 401, 772, 423], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 401.0], [772.0, 401.0], [772.0, 423.0], [183.0, 423.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、总给他人带来负面情绪的影响，或总是需要他人的安慰和劝导", "block_bbox": [183, 431, 701, 453], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 431.0], [701.0, 431.0], [701.0, 453.0], [183.0, 453.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、让身体持续处于疲惫和劳累状态", "block_bbox": [184, 460, 468, 481], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 460.0], [467.0, 460.0], [467.0, 480.0], [184.0, 480.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、总是感觉心累", "block_bbox": [183, 490, 326, 511], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 490.0], [325.0, 490.0], [325.0, 510.0], [183.0, 510.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "[100]", "block_bbox": [570, 716, 614, 738], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[570.0, 716.0], [613.0, 716.0], [613.0, 737.0], [570.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 492, 932], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [492.0, 900.0], [492.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：比较成熟的心态，善于看到事物好的一面，具备把坏事变好事的能力，不断地进步和提升。", "block_bbox": [199, 975, 1051, 1031], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 975.0], [1051.0, 975.0], [1051.0, 1031.0], [199.0, 1031.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：达到比较成熟的心态，不论遇到什么程度的困难和挫折，都能够保持理性，非常冷静地面对和处理，也善于看到事物中好的一面，积极的把坏事转变成好事，通过这样的经历有很多收获，不断地得到进步和提升，成就自己。", "block_bbox": [200, 1049, 1050, 1135], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 1049.0], [1050.0, 1049.0], [1050.0, 1135.0], [200.0, 1135.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1161, 318, 1183], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1160.9998779296875], [317.0, 1160.9998779296875], [317.0, 1181.9998779296875], [202.0, 1181.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、心态成熟稳重，不情绪化或处理感性情绪的时间极短，能够理性、冷静、乐观地解决各类事情", "block_bbox": [219, 1201, 987, 1223], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1201.0], [987.0, 1201.0], [987.0, 1223.0], [219.0, 1223.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、欣然接纳不好事情的状态——“真好，自己成长的机会又来了，这是历练我的心态、提升能力”", "block_bbox": [219, 1231, 990, 1254], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1231.0], [990.0, 1231.0], [990.0, 1254.0], [219.0, 1254.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、善于看到事物好的一面，良好的反思习惯——“我们能够从中学习到什么”", "block_bbox": [218, 1261, 833, 1284], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1261.0], [833.0, 1261.0], [833.0, 1284.0], [218.0, 1284.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、做最坏的打算，往最好的方向上努力", "block_bbox": [219, 1292, 541, 1315], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1292.0], [541.0, 1292.0], [541.0, 1315.0], [219.0, 1315.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、最大化地把坏事转化成好事", "block_bbox": [220, 1324, 469, 1345], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1324.0], [468.0, 1324.0], [468.0, 1344.0], [220.0, 1344.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1367, 336, 1389], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1367.0], [335.0, 1367.0], [335.0, 1388.0], [202.0, 1388.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、遇到不好的事情，总会有“为什么总是发生这样的事”或“为什么总是发生在我身上”的想法", "block_bbox": [217, 1406, 987, 1430], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 1406.0], [987.0, 1406.0], [987.0, 1430.0], [217.0, 1430.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[101]", "block_bbox": [610, 1478, 653, 1497], "block_id": 23, "block_order": null, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[610.0, 1478.0], [652.0, 1478.0], [652.0, 1496.0], [610.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7901408076286316, "coordinate": [166, 141, 455, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 141.0], [455.0, 141.0], [455.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7275926470756531, "coordinate": [165, 214, 300, 236], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 214.0], [299.0, 214.0], [299.0, 235.0], [165.0, 235.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8007940053939819, "coordinate": [182, 253, 595, 276], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 253.0], [595.0, 253.0], [595.0, 276.0], [182.0, 276.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7879318594932556, "coordinate": [182, 283, 629, 305], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 283.0], [629.0, 283.0], [629.0, 305.0], [182.0, 305.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7568360567092896, "coordinate": [183, 313, 325, 335], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[182.99998474121094, 312.9999694824219], [323.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219], [323.99993896484375, 333.9999694824219], [182.99998474121094, 333.9999694824219]]}, {"cls_id": 22,